{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51862","headline":"题蓟州桃李寺 · 无名氏","name":"题蓟州桃李寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧有桃花树，人呼寺故云。\n石危秋鹭上，滩远夜僧闻。\n汲井连黄叶，登台散白云。\n烧丹勾漏合，无处不逢君。\n（以上孙承泽《天府广记》四二《失名唐人诗》，见石刻。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}